// Ask latency over time by Provider (time chart)
// Is the Tonight page getting slower, and on which Provider? p95 of the whole "Ask" span (cache,
// embedding, retrieval and ranking) in 15-minute buckets, one line per Provider.
//
// The Ask span's Provider is the SearchIndex:Provider setting as typed ("Cosmos"), while the retrieval
// span's is lower case ("cosmos"). Filter on either with =~ (case-insensitive), not == (exact).
AppDependencies
| where TimeGenerated > ago(24h)
| where Name == "Ask"
| extend Provider = tostring(Properties["meepleledger.provider"])
| summarize p95 = percentile(DurationMs, 95) by Provider, bin(TimeGenerated, 15m)
| render timechart
